  "limitations": [
    "Natural support is 54 declared initial profiles times all 64 request/signal tapes, under the registered same-objective owner policy; it is not every policy reachable state space or a natural physical workload history.",
    "The 24 reversals all belong to the full supplied boundary mesh. Supplied budgets and posteriors are legal injected observations, not claimed reachable from the declared initial histories. No natural preference action gain was found in 2716 states despite 1608 root preference and 1818 recursive value changes.",
    "The no-adaptation arm resets the posterior and freezes preferences together. In all natural states the same-belief frozen-preference arm chooses the dynamic action, so the 84 losses also expose posterior relevance conditional on frozen preferences; do not call this an isolated dynamic-preference treatment effect.",
    "Conditional regret compares the chosen first action with optimal continuation thereafter. It is not the value of the comparison controller throughout the episode. Only fixed-policy sufficiency is separately evaluated as a whole policy.",
    "The misleading environment supplies known 0.2 signal reliability. Correct inference can use anti-informative signals; deliberate posterior inversion is a model-error intervention, not a trained predictor failure rate.",
    "Same-objective equality is numerical correctness and shows the observed benefits are reproducible by ordinary finite control. NDU-exclusive benefit and physical net benefit are not established.",
    "Physical witnesses recreate cache residency and execute a current chosen action, with model resource units retained separately from measured nanoseconds. They do not establish model utility as elapsed-time benefit or natural physical reachability.",
    "The boundary mesh was declared after disclosed reference-only development exploration. All registered states were retained and physical witnesses selected lexicographically before physical timings; this is mechanism qualification, not an undisclosed blind effect-size holdout.",
    "No conclusion follows about learned continuation models, identifiable latent preference parameters, parameter gradients, FBSDE solution quality, production compiler qualification, or generalization beyond this finite model.",
    "Earlier v1 zero-variation and ablation-null episode findings remain unchanged; these supplied-state witnesses must not be relabeled as v1 natural holdout wins."
  ],
